---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: News & Alerts
eyebrow: Newsroom
lede: Announcements, road closures, service changes, and press releases from town departments.
tags: []
breadcrumbs: []
---

{% include "partials/page-header.njk" %}

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]">
    <div>
      <h2 class="sr-only">All news items</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-8">
        {% for post in collections.news %}
          <li class="border-b border-navy-100 pb-8 last:border-0">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-bay-700">
              {{ post.data.category or "Announcement" }}
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-display text-xl font-bold">
              <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="text-navy-900 no-underline hover:underline"
                >{{ post.data.title }}</a
              >
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-navy-700">{{ post.data.lede }}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-navy-500">
              <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
              &middot; {{ post.data.author }}
            </p>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <aside class="no-print space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded border border-navy-100 bg-navy-50 p-5">
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold">Emergency alerts</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-navy-700">
          Osprey Point uses the Sedgemere County alert system for evacuations, boil-water
          notices, and severe weather. Sign-up is free.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
          <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-bay-700 no-underline hover:underline"
            >How to sign up &rarr;</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded border border-navy-100 p-5">
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold">Media inquiries</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-navy-700">
          Press contacts route through the Office of the Town Manager.
        </p>
        <dl class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-navy-500">Phone</dt>
            <dd>(609) 555-0110</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-navy-500">Email</dt>
            <dd class="break-all">townhall@ospreypoint.example.gov</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
